<title>UK: Moulinex details 300 million French franc FRN.</title>
<headline>Moulinex details 300 million French franc FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Bankers Trust International and Credit Lyonnais.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MOULINEX</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN FFR   BASE	 3M-PIBOR  MATURITY  * 15.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +210 BP   PAY DATE    15.JUL.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   1.00</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p> NOTES   *  CALL AT 103.50 IN JULY 2000 AND AT 101.25 IN JULY 2001</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX/PAR   DENOMS (M) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 1</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  FRANCE    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.75	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	BEARER FORM, EUROCLEAR AND CEDEL CLEARING</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
